WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.603
E ɓaawo karnijum 19, laamu Ouagadougou woni go'oto nder laamorde mossi ɓurɗe semmbe.

00:00:06.683 --> 00:00:11.376
Kanko woni laamiiɗo Muggo Naaba, laamiijo Muggo, leydi Mosi.

00:00:11.456 --> 00:00:15.831
E oon sahaa, ko Naaba Wobgo, anndiraa ko Boukary Koutou.

00:00:15.911 --> 00:00:20.286
Wakkati maajum mawɓe Orop ɗon hawta bee Afrik hirnaange.

00:00:20.366 --> 00:00:27.923
Luttuɓe konu Farayse naati nder leydi ndii ngam ɗaɓɓa laamu maɓɓe dow ummaatooje ɗe ɓe ngaddani.

00:00:28.003 --> 00:00:35.879
Mawɗo Muggo Naaba on no wi'aayi hokkude laamu makko to maɓɓe; o yiɗi o jooɗoto hooreejo saare maako.

00:00:35.959 --> 00:00:42.163
E hitaande 1896, koloneeji Farayse ngari to Ouagadougou, ɓe njaɓi gariiri ndin.

00:00:42.243 --> 00:00:45.266
Naaba Wobgo waawi yaajugo laamorgo mum.

00:00:45.346 --> 00:00:51.630
E wi'aago dow maako, o ɗaɓɓiti haɓre bee yimɓe maako, ammaa o heɓii laamu maako.

00:00:51.710 --> 00:00:54.494
Farayse'en njooɗi mo laamiiɗo feere.

00:00:54.574 --> 00:01:05.314
Naaba Wobgo boo, o yahdi to fombina, haa nokkuuje ɗe Britanniyankooɓe laamii ton, haa o yahugo nder lesdi, yaasi diga lesdi Ouagadougou.

00:01:05.394 --> 00:01:15.497
Yimɓe Burkina Faso heewɓe, Naaba Wobgo laati laamu: laamu laamiiɗo mo yiɗiri yaajugo suudu maako, ngam o jaɓɓaay laamuuji goɗɗi.

00:01:15.577 --> 00:01:22.816
Yimɓe nder lesdi Ouagadougou ɗon nji'a mo, ɓe ɗon wi'a haala maako bana ekkitinol teddungal.

00:01:22.896 --> 00:01:31.408
Taariiha'en ɗon ɗaɓɓa anndal dow wakkati maajum, nder defte koloniya'en e nder taariika nder suudu laamiiɗo.

00:01:31.488 --> 00:01:38.647
Fooyre ɗiɗi ɗe'e fuu mbaɗata haala gootol, ammaa ɗe kawti dow ko woni: Ouagadougou jaɓaayi.
